# 🔥🔥🔥 Very Important Pattern Recognition

You should start recognizing the question immediately.

### "Largest"

Think:

```text
largest = first element

if current > largest
    update
```

---

### "Smallest"

Think:

```text
smallest = first element

if current < smallest
    update
```

---

### "Second-largest"

Think:

```text
largest
secondLargest

If new largest:
    old largest → secondLargest
    new number → largest
```

---

### "Remove duplicates"

Think:

```text
Set
```

or:

```text
seen
```

---

### "Find duplicates"

Think:

```text
frequency > 1
```

or:

```text
seen + duplicates
```

---

### "Count frequency"

Think:

```text
value → count
```

Pattern:

```js
const frequency = {};

for (let item of array) {
  frequency[item] = (frequency[item] || 0) + 1;
}
```

---

# 🔥🔥🔥 Important Tricky Question

Predict:

```js
const numbers = [5, 5, 5, 10, 10, 20];

const frequency = {};

for (let num of numbers) {
  frequency[num] = (frequency[num] || 0) + 1;
}

console.log(frequency);
```

Output:

```text
{
  5: 3,
  10: 2,
  20: 1
}
```

So:

```text
largest       → 20
smallest      → 5
second-largest → 10
duplicates    → [5, 10]
```

Remove duplicates:

```text
[5, 10, 20]
```

---

# 🔥🔥🔥 Another Important Question

Predict:

```js
const numbers = [-10, -20, -5, -30];

let largest = numbers[0];
let smallest = numbers[0];

for (let i = 1; i < numbers.length; i++) {
  if (numbers[i] > largest) {
    largest = numbers[i];
  }

  if (numbers[i] < smallest) {
    smallest = numbers[i];
  }
}

console.log(largest);
console.log(smallest);
```

### Output

```text
-5
-30
```

This is why initializing with the first element is important.

---

# 🔥🔥🔥 One More Tricky Question

```js
const numbers = [10, 20, 5, 20, 15];

const unique = [...new Set(numbers)];

unique.sort((a, b) => b - a);

console.log(unique);
console.log(unique[1]);
```

### Output

```text
[20, 15, 10, 5]
15
```

Step-by-step:

```text
Original
[10,20,5,20,15]

       ↓ Set

[10,20,5,15]

       ↓ sort descending

[20,15,10,5]

       ↓ index 1

15
```

