# 🔥🔥🔥 Complexity

## Largest

```text
Time:  O(n)
Space: O(1)
```

## Smallest

```text
Time:  O(n)
Space: O(1)
```

## Second-largest — one loop

```text
Time:  O(n)
Space: O(1)
```

## Remove duplicates — Set

```text
Time:  O(n)
Space: O(n)
```

## Find duplicates — Set

```text
Time:  O(n)
Space: O(n)
```

## Frequency

```text
Time:  O(n)
Space: O(k)
```

where `k` is the number of unique elements.

